 her head."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"CZ75","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","value":"0.1","raw":"Shake"}],"speaker":"CZ75","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What's going on? I feel so dizzy... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"What did you do to me?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The world before CZ75 becomes obscured by layer upon layer of black silk..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Just before she plunges into complete darkness, she hears Ouroboros quietly whisper into her ear—"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ouroboros","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"A demon like me doesn't need friends."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"GF_21winter_avg_pathfinder","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Three days before the start of the survival battle, in the virtual data domain."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The shrill laughter constantly pursues her. No matter how hard she runs, it keeps echoing in her mind."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Ouroboros ducks into a safe zone, skilfully concealing herself among the countless AI storage tanks, then she curls up as much as she can to minimize her chances of being found."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Through the rows of tanks, some transparent, some opaque, she vigilantly watches the movements of her assaulters."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"AI 01","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We've lost her."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"AI 02","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Well, she's pretty much a one-trick pony, and when she's out of moves, she runs and hides in here."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"AI 01","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's alright. We'll find her and drag her out of her hidey-hole."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"AI 02","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But isn't that against the rules? It'll make Master mad..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"AI 01","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The master won't mind if it's a piece of trash with no combat capabilities."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_doorknock_wood","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The two of them split up to look for Ouroboros. Occasionally, they knock on the glass tanks to taunt their prey."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Ouroboros can tell from the sound that they're getting closer and closer."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"AI 01","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Don't be scared, the battle hasn't started yet. You won't be ruled out even if you get smashed to bits."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"AI 02","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"There won't be any safe zones for you once the battle begins in earnest!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ouroboros","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I thought we were friends..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ouroboros' feeble whisper evokes derisive laughter from her opponents."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"AI 01","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"She's pretty damn naive, isn't she?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"AI 02","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Do you even understand the situation you're in? Only one of us is going to survive this battle."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_whitenoise","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Though she has no physical form, Ouroboros can hear something break inside her."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ouroboros","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So it was all a lie..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"AI 02","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yup. How else would we learn your weaknesses if we didn't deceive you?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"AI 01","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hahaha, but seriously, this is the first time I've ever seen a brainlet who took the bait right away."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"\"Hey, look, this website says our AIs are 99.9% compatible!\""}]},{"spans":[{"text":"\"Then let's be friends, 'kay~ We'll get out of this place together!\""}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"AI 02","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I can't believe she actually fell for such nonsense ahahahaha—"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_whitenoise","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The speed of the breaking grows faster..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ouroboros","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Unforgivable..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Unforgivable..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Unforgivable unforgivable unforgivable... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Unforgivable unforgivable unforgivable unforgivable unforgivable unforgivable unforgivable unforgivable unforgivable unforgivable unforgivable unforgivable unforgivable unforgivable unforgivable...!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_keyboardtype_sci","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Execute command, delete folder \"Friends\" and all memory data within... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Large shift in personality parameters detected. Recalibrating..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"AI 01","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ha, found you."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The two AIs smirk as they approach Ouroboros. Their long, looming shadows fall over Ouroboros' legs, like tentacles stretching out from a swamp."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ouroboros","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Adjustment complete. Inoperative settings deleted."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ouroboros","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You have a point."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"AI 01","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ouroboros","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Demons like us don't need friends."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ouroboros gets back on her feet. It feels more than just a simple motion - it's like she has broken free of her shackles. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It's as though something inside her has been shattered beyond repair, but at the same time, she feels like she has been reborn."}]}]}]}
